  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOCAL COMMUNITY INVOLVEMENT ON LOGGERHEAD (CARETTA CARETTA) CONSERVATION ACTIVITIES IN BOA VISTA ISLAND (CABO VERDE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PURPOSE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO IMPLEMENT NESTING BEACH CONSERVATION PROGRAMS ON BEACHES THAT INCLUDE ABOUT 40 PERCENT OF THE LOGGERHEAD NESTING ACTIVITY ON THE ISLAND OF BOA VISTA. ACTIVITIES INCLUDE: 1.ACTIVITIES INCLUDE SETTING UP TWO FIELD CAMPS TO SUPPORT DAILY PATROLS ON ERVATAO AND PORTO FERREIRA BEACHES THROUGHOUT THE NESTING SEASON THAT WILL COMPLEMENT THE NESTING BEACH COVERAGE OF THE TURTLE FOUNDATION AND ACTIVITIES OF BIOS.CV ON BOA VISTA AND 2. CONDUCTING OUTREACH AND EDUCATION AND COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS WITH LOCAL COMMUNITIES.</narrative>
  </description>
